    "body": "I'd put this just below char and bool above as they all relate to integral types, rather than interspersed between float-related things (float16 and complex).\r\n\r\nAlso, is long long correct, or should it be \"smallest primitive integer type\" so long gets used on RV32? Using unsigned int is a bit weird potentially too, would have to see what other ABIs do here.",
